	"Shoots one enemy from long range for 40 every second.": "从远处每秒对一名敌人射出 40 伤害。",
	"A thick gate of armor. 200 blood, 15 damage, short reach, one target.": "一道厚厚的甲门。200 血，15 伤害，近距离，一个目标。",
	"Slow to call. Cuts one enemy for 50 every second.": "召唤得慢。每秒对一名敌人斩下 50。",
	"The spear reaches mid range and hits one enemy for 20 every second.": "枪伸到中距离，每秒打中一名敌人 20。",
	"Rushes in from mid distance and stands across all three roads. Every 3 seconds, every enemy in short range on every road takes 80. Enemies on every road can strike back.": "从中距离冲入，横站在三条路上。每 3 秒，每一条路上近距离内的每个敌人受到 80。每一条路上的敌人都能反击。",
	"Fast. Hits one enemy for 30 every second.": "很快。每秒打中一名敌人 30。",
	"Rushes from mid distance. The blast hits everyone in short range for 100, and 40 of that blood is their own.": "从中距离冲来。爆炸对近距离内的每个人造成 100，其中 40 血是他们自己的。",
	"She blinks past every other enemy, as many times as she needs, and crosses roads to reach her mark. She only kills an archer, a leveling caster, or a healing caster. The cut is 50.": "她按需要的次数闪过其他每一个敌人，并跨路去到她的目标。她只杀弓手、升级术士或治疗术士。那一刀是 50。",
	"Heals the ally in front of her with the least blood, 40 blood each second, at long range.": "每秒治疗她前面血最少的盟友 40 血，距离很远。",
	"The ally in front with the highest damage gains 20% damage and 20% blood. A second caster can add another 20%. The same caster does not stack twice.": "前面伤害最高的盟友得到 20% 伤害和 20% 血。第二名术士可以再加 20%。同一名术士不会叠两次。",
	"Black hood, silver bands, and a silver sword.": "黑兜帽，银环，一把银剑。",
	"Green scarf, green eyes, bow, and a quiver.": "绿围巾，绿眼睛，弓，和一个箭袋。",
	"Brown coat and a round gold shield.": "棕外套，一面圆的金盾。",
	"Black hood, red scarf, and a dark curved sword.": "黑兜帽，红围巾，一把暗色弯剑。",
	"Blue hood and a blue spear.": "蓝兜帽，一杆蓝枪。",
	"Red armor, bare arms, and a gold axe.": "红甲，露臂，一把金斧。",
	"Black rider, red saddle, and a gold sword.": "黑骑手，红鞍，一把金剑。",
	"Black hood, red sash, and a lit bomb.": "黑兜帽，红腰带，一颗点着的爆弹。",
	"Purple hood and a purple dagger.": "紫兜帽，一把紫短刃。",
	"White robe and a teal crystal staff.": "白袍，一柄青水晶法杖。",
	"Gold hood and an open scroll.": "金兜帽，一卷打开的卷轴。",
	"White hood, red scarf, and a silver sword.": "白兜帽，红围巾，一把银剑。",
	"Walker. It strikes one fighter at short range.": "行者。它在近距离打一名战士。",
	"Runner. It is faster than a walker, and it strikes sooner.": "奔者。它比行者更快，也更早出手。",
	"Herald. It calls two other monsters every few seconds.": "号手。它每隔几秒召唤两只其他怪物。",
	"Viper. Its bite holds a fighter. For a short time they cannot move or attack, and they hold the hurt pose until it ends.": "蝮。它的咬困住一名战士。有一小段时间他们不能移动或攻击，并保持受伤的姿势，直到结束。",
	"Shell. It is slow, hits softly, and carries a great deal of blood.": "厚壳。它很慢，打得很轻，带着很多血。",
	"Howler. A short blade cannot reach it. It swings onto an archer or a caster, and an archer can shoot it.": "嚎者。短刃够不到它。它荡向弓手或术士，弓手可以射它。",
	"Reaver. It hits harder, and it strikes one fighter.": "掠者。它打得更重，打一名战士。",
	"Storm. Lightning hits one fighter, then jumps to four others, one by one.": "雷暴。闪电打中一名战士，然后一个一个跳到另外四个身上。",
	"Oni. A heavy blow hits everyone in range on its road.": "鬼。沉重的一击打中它那条路上范围内的每个人。",
	"Moth. It flies on one road. A short blade cannot reach it.": "蛾。它在一条路上飞。短刃够不到它。",
	"Elder. It appears on the road, strikes whoever is nearest, and then it fades.": "老者。它出现在路上，打最近的人，然后消失。",
	"Glut. It eats the fighter in front, then sits and heals.": "饕。它吃掉前面的战士，然后坐下并治疗。",
	"Brood. It bites one fighter. When it dies, three Lings crawl out.": "巢。它咬一名战士。它死去时，三只幼爬出来。",
	"Ling. A small fast biter that crawls out of Brood.": "幼。从巢里爬出的小而快的咬者。",
	"Knives. It matches the sword soldier, and it strikes one fighter at short range.": "短刃。它对应剑士，在近距离打一名战士。",
	"Firebow. A hard shot, then fire stays on that spot.": "火弓。一记重射，然后火留在那个位置。",
	"Fan. It blows its road and pushes the fighters in front back.": "扇。它吹自己的路，把前面的战士往后推。",
	"Ward. A great shield, and a great deal of blood.": "大盾。一面大盾，很多血。",
	"Javelin. It throws long shots, then fights up close.": "投枪。它丢出远射，然后近身打。",
	"Drum. It deals no damage. It lifts three allies at once.": "鼓。它不造成伤害。它一次抬起三名盟友。",
	"Crow. It waits, then the first strike is heavy. After that it fights up close.": "鸦。它等候，然后第一击很重。之后它近身打。",
	"Cow. It waits, then it charges. After that it fights up close, slower than the crow.": "牛。它等候，然后冲锋。之后它近身打，比鸦更慢。",
	"Smog. It deals no damage. Smoke hides the road where it walks.": "烟。它不造成伤害。烟雾藏起它走过的路。",
	"Buck. It fires a shotgun, then it reloads.": "霰。它开霰弹枪，然后装填。",
	"Scope. One long heavy shot, and it has little blood.": "瞄。一发长而重的枪，血很少。",
	"Aria. The song lifts every ally on every road.": "咏。歌声提升每一条路上的每一个盟友。",
	"Bomber. It is fragile, and the hit is heavy.": "爆者。它很脆，一击很重。",
	"General. It walks out when the gate breaks. The level ends when the general dies.": "将军。城门破时它走出来。将军死去，这一关就结束。",
	"Walks one road and strikes one fighter at short range.": "走一条路，在近距离打一名战士。",
	"Faster than a walker, and the next blow comes sooner.": "比行者更快，下一击也来得更早。",
	"The bite holds one fighter still for 2 seconds. For a short time they cannot move or attack, and they hold the hurt pose until it ends. A healing caster can clear it. If two fighters are in front, it bites the one who hits harder and does not hold them. Most blows miss the viper.": "这一咬让一名战士停住 2 秒。有一小段时间他们不能移动或攻击，并保持受伤的姿势，直到结束。治疗术士可以解除。如果前面有两名战士，它咬打得较重的那一个，并不困住他们。大多数攻击打不中蝮。",
	"Waits, then lightning hits the fighter in front and jumps to four others, one by one. For a short time they cannot move or attack, and they hold the hurt pose until it ends.": "它等候，然后闪电打中前面的战士，再一个一个跳到另外四个身上。有一小段时间他们不能移动或攻击，并保持受伤的姿势，直到结束。",
	"Calls two other monsters every few seconds. Those calls pay no value when they fall.": "每隔几秒召唤两只其他怪物。那些召唤倒下时不给价值。",
	"Slow, hits softly, and carries a great deal of blood.": "很慢，打得很轻，带着很多血。",
	"A harder hitter for a moderate call. One target.": "中等召唤里打得较重。一个目标。",
	"A heavy blow that hits everyone in range on its road. Slow, and very hard to bring down.": "沉重的一击打中它那条路上范围内的每个人。很慢，也很难打倒。",
	"Flies on one road. A short weapon cannot hit it, and those fighters stop beneath it, though they still fight a closer fighter on the ground.": "在一条路上飞。短兵器打不到它，那些战士停在它下面，不过他们仍会打地面上更近的战士。",
	"Appears somewhere on the road, strikes whoever is nearest, friend or foe, and fades after 15 seconds. Many blows miss Elder.": "出现在路上某处，打最近的人，无论友敌，15 秒后消失。许多攻击打不中老者。",
	"Bites one fighter. When it dies, three quick Lings crawl out.": "咬一名战士。它死去时，三只快的幼爬出来。",
	"A small fast biter that crawls out of Brood. It does not split again.": "从巢里爬出的小而快的咬者。它不会再分裂。",
	"Matches the sword soldier. One target, at short range.": "对应剑士。一个目标，近距离。",
	"Fragile. The hit is heavy, and it strikes the berserker when one is alive.": "很脆。一击很重，若有狂战士活着就打狂战士。",
	"A great shield and a great deal of blood. The hit stays at 5.": "一面大盾，很多血。伤害停在 5。",
	"Deals no damage. It lifts three allies at once, the way a leveling caster lifts one.": "不造成伤害。它一次抬起三名盟友，就像升级术士抬起一个。",
	"Deals no damage. Smoke follows where it walks and hides that stretch for 10 seconds.": "不造成伤害。烟跟着它走，把那一段藏起 10 秒。",
	"Fires a shotgun once a second, four times, then reloads for 2 seconds. The shot reaches 100.": "每秒开一枪，四次，然后装填 2 秒。这一枪达到 100。",
	"Fires one long heavy shot every 3 seconds, and has little blood.": "每 3 秒开一发长而重的枪，血很少。",
	"Deals no damage. The song lifts every ally on every road at once, at half the strength of a leveling caster. A second song does not stack.": "不造成伤害。歌声一次提升每一条路上的每一个盟友，强度是升级术士的一半。第二首歌不会叠加。",
	"Strikes one fighter on its own road.": "在自己的路上打一名战士。",
	"Nine of these walk out when the gate breaks, three on each road. Kill all nine and this call is yours. The numbers above are what those nine have.": "城门破时，九个走出来，每条路三个。杀掉全部九个，这个召唤就是你的。上面的数字是那九个的数值。",
	"Walks out when the gate breaks. The level ends when this one dies.": "城门破时走出来。这一个死去，这一关就结束。",
