	"Close ranks": "收拢队列",
	"The horn": "号角",
	"Last banner": "最后的旗",
	"The general": "将军",
	"They return": "他们回来",
	"Same horns": "同样的角",
	"The same hour": "同一个时辰",
	"No scatter": "没有溃散",
	"Who sent them": "谁派他们来",
	"A maker": "一个制造者",
	"Ash on the road": "路上的灰",
	"Counted out": "点过数",
	"The guess": "那个猜测",
	"Halfway back": "回来的一半",
	"No chain": "没有锁链",
	"Still the soldiers": "仍是那些士兵",
	"Three roads": "三条路",
	"A workshop": "一座工坊",
	"A person could": "人也能",
	"Buried horns": "埋掉的角",
	"Send and break": "派来与打破",
	"No new soldier": "没有新兵",
	"Tired of guessing": "厌倦猜测",
	"Long enough": "够久了",
	"The old road": "旧路",
	"Soldiers on the path": "路上的士兵",
	"Horns again": "角又来了",
	"Red on the road": "路上的红",
	"The descent": "下行",
	"A human gate": "人的城门",
	"Monsters below": "下方的怪物",
	"The last sash": "最后的腰带",
	"Above the village": "村子之上",
	"The two armies": "两支军队",
	"Break their gate. Nine come out, three on each road. Kill them all.": "打破他们的城门。九个走出来，每条路三个。全部杀掉。",
	"Break their gate. A general walks out. The level ends when the general dies.": "打破他们的城门。一名将军走出来。将军死去，这一关就结束。",
	"On the road to the village where they were born.": "在通往他们出生的村子的路上。",
	"Monsters again. The clan still thinks the soldiers made them.": "又是怪物。一族仍然认为是士兵造了他们。",
	"Human soldiers on the mountain road.": "人类士兵在山路上。",
	"Monsters on the three roads. Hold the clan gate.": "怪物在三条路上。守住一族的城门。",
	"The monsters do not leave. The sword is still the only call.": "怪物没有离开。剑仍是唯一的召唤。",
	"Mist on the ridge. There are more of them than yesterday.": "山脊上有雾。他们比昨天更多。",
	"They hold the gate. No new weapon today.": "他们守着城门。今天没有新的兵器。",
	"Two roads fill at once. The clan does not break.": "两条路同时涌满。一族没有溃散。",
	"Night on the mountain. The horns keep coming.": "山上的夜。角一直涌来。",
	"A fast one slips through. The hero runs it down.": "一个快的溜了过去。英雄追上去了结它。",
	"Cold stone, and another wave.": "冷石，又一波。",
	"The gate holds. They learn nothing new.": "城门守住了。他们没有学到新的东西。",
	"White cloud hides the road. The shapes still find it.": "白云遮住了路。那些形影还是找得到。",
	"A last quiet between the blows. Then they come again.": "打击之间最后的安静。然后他们又来了。",
	"The new monsters keep rank. The clan says a human hand sent them.": "新的怪物保持队列。一族说，是一只人的手派他们来的。",
	"They arrive at the same hour the soldiers once did.": "他们在士兵从前抵达的同一个时辰到来。",
	"Wild things do not wait for a drum. These do.": "野兽不等鼓声。这些会等。",
	"The clan looks at the horns and still sees a maker.": "一族看着那些角，仍看见一个制造者。",
	"No scatter, no hunger. They come to the gate and stop.": "没有溃散，没有饥饿。他们来到城门前就停下。",
	"Ash on the road, and the same number as yesterday.": "路上有灰，数目和昨天一样。",
	"Someone is counting them out.": "有人在点着他们的数目。",
	"The mountain asks who. The clan answers: the soldiers.": "山问是谁。一族回答：那些士兵。",
	"Half of these attacks are done. The guess has not changed.": "这些攻击过了一半。猜测没有变。",
	"They hold a broken horn up to the light and see no chain.": "他们把一只断角举到光里，看不见锁链。",
	"Still they say the soldiers built these bodies.": "他们仍然说，是士兵造了这些身体。",
	"A quiet hour, then the same three roads.": "安静了一个时辰，然后还是同样的三条路。",
	"The gate shakes. They talk of a workshop in the low country.": "城门在震。他们说起低地里的一座工坊。",
	"If a person can call a sword, a person could call a monster.": "人若能召唤一把剑，人也就能召唤一只怪物。",
	"They bury the dead horns away from the huts.": "他们把死掉的角埋到屋舍远处。",
	"The pattern holds. Send, break, send.": "这个样子一直如此。派来，打破，再派来。",
	"No new soldier walks out of these gates. Only the same beasts.": "没有新的士兵从这些门里走出来。只有同样的野兽。",
	"One more night of horns. The clan is tired of guessing.": "又是一夜的角。一族厌倦了猜测。",
	"They have lived with the guess long enough.": "他们带着这个猜测活得够久了。",
	"The gate breaks. Nine archers step out, three on each road.": "城门破了。九名弓手走出来，每条路三个。",
	"The clan lives through the arrows.": "一族从箭下活了下来。",
	"They pick up the bows and learn the shot.": "他们拾起弓，学会了射击。",
	"Nine lancers come off the broken gate, three on each road.": "九名枪兵从破门里出来，每条路三个。",
	"The spears stop short of the clan.": "那些枪停在一族之前。",
	"They take the spear and learn its reach.": "他们拿起枪，学会它的距离。",
	"Nine shield-bearers plant themselves, three on each road.": "九名盾卫立定，每条路三个。",
	"The wall holds, and then it breaks.": "那道墙守住了，然后破了。",
	"They lift the shields and learn to stand.": "他们举起盾，学会站住。",
	"Nine riders pour out, three on each road.": "九名骑手涌出，每条路三个。",
	"The clan meets the charge and stays.": "一族迎上冲锋，留了下来。",
	"They take the horses and learn the speed.": "他们牵过马，学会那速度。",
	"Nine assassins slip out, three on each road.": "九名刺客溜出，每条路三个。",
	"One blinks behind the line. The clan turns in time.": "一个闪到队列后面。一族及时转身。",
	"They learn the blink, and the cut that follows.": "他们学会闪现，以及随后的那一刀。",
	"Nine sabers walk out, three on each road.": "九把弯刀走出来，每条路三个。",
	"The long cuts are slow, and the clan answers them.": "那些长斩很慢，一族回应了它们。",
	"They take up the long blade.": "他们拿起长刃。",
	"Nine bombers rush out, three on each road.": "九名爆者冲出，每条路三个。",
	"The blasts take blood from both sides. The clan remains.": "爆炸取走两边的血。一族还在。",
	"They learn the bomb, and what it costs.": "他们学会爆弹，以及它的代价。",
	"Nine healing casters step out, three on each road.": "九名治疗术士走出来，每条路三个。",
	"They mend the monsters. The clan cuts them down anyway.": "他们修补怪物。一族还是砍倒了他们。",
	"They learn the staff, and how to give blood back.": "他们学会法杖，以及如何把血还回去。",
	"Nine leveling casters come out, three on each road.": "九名升级术士出来，每条路三个。",
	"The monsters grow stronger beside them. The clan ends it.": "怪物在他们身旁变强。一族了结了这一切。",
	"They learn the scroll, and how to raise one of their own.": "他们学会卷轴，以及如何抬起自己人里的一个。",
	"Nine axe fighters come out, three on each road.": "九名斧士出来，每条路三个。",
	"They are heavy, and they fall one road at a time.": "他们很重，一条路一条路地倒下。",
	"The clan learns the axe. One berserker will stand across all three roads.": "一族学会了斧。一名狂战士将横站在三条路上。",
	"They were small, and the village was not kind.": "他们很小，而村子并不仁慈。",
	"Get out.": "出去。",
	"There was no place for them there.": "那里没有他们的地方。",
	"Leave.": "离开。",
	"They took the thin road into the cloud.": "他们走上那条细路，进入云里。",
	"The mountain did not know their names. That was enough.": "山不知道他们的名字。这就够了。",
	"For a while, the wind was the only visitor.": "有一阵子，风是唯一的来客。",
	"Then shapes came up the lower road.": "然后形影从下路走上来。",
	"We only know this.": "我们只知道这些。",
	"The sword.": "那把剑。",
	"The mountain learned their names too.": "山也学会了他们的名字。",
	"Months pass. The monsters stop coming.": "几个月过去。怪物不再来。",
	"Other clans have heard of the mountain. One ninja can meet one ninja.": "别的一族听说过这座山。一个忍者可以遇见一个忍者。",
	"Then banners show on the lower road.": "然后旗帜出现在下路上。",
	"The monsters come back up the mountain.": "怪物又爬上山来。",
	"The clan asks why monsters and human soldiers have both come for them.": "一族问，为什么怪物和人类士兵都来找他们。",
