	"This is a side-view gate battle. Your clan gate is on the left. The cursed gate is on the right. Both have 2000 blood.\n\nFighters and the hero are born on the ground behind their own gate, so a new call is not standing in the fight. The other side cannot walk past a gate into the ground behind it. Someone standing there can still hit a fighter in front of that gate when the attack reaches. A blow that would have hit someone behind the gate hits the gate instead. A fighter who stays behind their castle for 10 seconds is set down in front of it.\n\nYou start with one call, the sword ninja. A lesson ends when their gate breaks and nine of that monster come out, three on each road. Kill all nine and that soldier is yours. Until you know six, bring who you have. After that, choose 6. Value builds by itself. Hold the phone or iPad sideways. Press the field and the stick appears under that hand, then follows the drag. The call buttons sit along the bottom, and Sword and Shoot sit at the bottom right.\n\nThere are three roads. Soldiers only march forward on the road where you called them, and they fight only that road. The Berserker stands across all three roads, hits every road at once, and enemies on every road can hit the Berserker. The assassin blinks past every other fighter and crosses roads to kill an archer, a leveling caster, or a healing caster. She cuts no one else. The first time a house falls to half blood, a wind helps that side: fighters of the other team who have crossed the middle are blown back to the center and lose half of the blood they still have. You move the hero onto any road with the stick under your hand, or with WASD. J and K match Sword and Shoot. Number keys call the soldiers you brought, in order, onto the hero's road.\n\nIf a runner slips past the line, you are the one who runs back. If your gate breaks, you lose. On a lesson, breaking their gate is not the end: nine of that monster walk out, and you win when those nine are dead. On level 40, a general walks out after their gate falls, and you win when the general dies. Every other level ends when their gate breaks.\n\nWhen their gate is down to a quarter of its blood, they immediately gain their starting gold again. At half blood, on every level, they gain 100 value at once. From level 20 on they also gain 100 value when the gate is still at 70% blood.\n\nThe other gate calls its own fighters. On levels 1 to 19 the fight starts with walkers, and each other monster of that band joins on a later level, one at a time. From level 20 they are walkers, runners, a howler, a viper, a storm, a herald, a shell, a reaver, and an oni. From level 41 those monsters are faster and harder, and Moth, Elder, Glut, and Brood join them. The howler hangs behind its castle. Only an archer can hit it there. It swings from behind the castle onto the road, and onto an archer, a leveling caster, or a healing caster when one is alive, then stays on the road. The viper's bite holds one fighter still for 2 seconds. For a short time they cannot move or attack, and they hold the hurt pose until it ends. A healing caster can clear it. If two fighters are in front, it bites the one who hits harder and does not hold them. Most blows miss the viper. The storm waits 4 seconds, then lightning hits the fighter in front and jumps to four others, one by one, and holds each for 1 second. The herald calls two other monsters every 3 seconds. The shell is slow, hits softly, and carries a great deal of blood. The reaver is a harder hitter for a moderate call. Moth flies on one road. A short weapon cannot hit it, and those fighters stop beneath it, though they still fight a closer fighter on the ground. Elder appears somewhere on the road, strikes whoever is nearest, friend or foe, and fades after 15 seconds. Many blows miss Elder. Glut is very slow. It eats the fighter in front, except a berserker or a flyer, then sits for 5 seconds and heals. Brood bites, and when it dies three quick Lings crawl out. On soldier levels they wear modern kit, and they hit harder than before. Knives match the sword soldier. The firebow is thin-blooded and hits hard, then leaves fire on that spot for 3 seconds. The fan is thin-blooded, barely hurts, and once every 10 seconds it blows its road. The gust hits only the other side, pushing those fighters in front of it back by a quarter of the road. A berserker ignores that gust and covers the fighters behind him. That gust also stretches any fire or ice and keeps it burning 2 seconds longer. Each road holds at most two. The ward carries a great shield, a great deal of blood, and hits for 5. The javelin throws five long heavy shots, then fights up close with a short sword. The drum lifts three allies at once, the way a leveling caster lifts one. On levels 21 to 40 a cow waits 4 seconds, then the first charge hits harder than the blows after it, and it fights up close, slower and softer than a rider. From level 41 a crow does the same and hits harder: it waits 3 seconds, strikes the first enemy hard, then fights like the horse rider. From level 61, Smog, Buck, Scope, and Aria join them. Smog deals no damage and lays smoke where it walks. The smoke hides that stretch for 10 seconds. Buck fires a shotgun once a second, four times, then reloads for 2 seconds. Scope fires a long heavy shot every 3 seconds and has little blood. Aria sings, and the lift is half of a leveling caster, on every ally on every road at once. The bomber is fragile, its hit is heavy, and it strikes the berserker when one is alive. Level 40's general is an officer.\n\nPlay lists seventy levels. The first is open. Winning a level opens the next. Levels 1 to 20 are monsters, and that is where each soldier is learned. Levels 21 to 40 are human soldiers. Levels 41 to 60 are monsters again, and the new monsters begin. Levels 61 to 70 alternate, monster then soldier, starting with monsters. The new soldiers begin on the soldier turns. Your purse stays the same. Theirs gets heavier as the levels climb, and it eases a little when the soldiers first arrive. Before you choose who to bring, the level shows the other side, each fighter with a skin and a name. Press a name to read blood, damage, attacking distance, attacking range, speed, and the special skill.\n\nEach level you open pays 100 diamonds. Clearing a level also pays coins. The base is 200 coins times the level. Three minutes or less doubles that, five minutes or less adds half, six minutes or less pays the base, and a longer clear pays half. On a level you have not cleared, the fight also pays 0.25% of that base each second it is still going. Those coins stay if your gate falls. A level you have already cleared does not pay this. On a cleared level, Automatic finish skips the fight and pays the coins from your last clear. You can take that 50 times. While any are missing, 5 return every half hour. Until a clear is remembered, the stake is the base. Coins are not diamonds. Home has Upgrade. The hero and each soldier you have learned can be ranked 20 times. Each rank adds 5% of that character's blood and damage. Reach, cost, and speed stay the same. Upgrade can also raise your castle blood by 200 a time, and your value by 0.1 each second a time. Twenty is the last. Every 10 levels you choose a skill, skills rank up like fighters, and each use costs 45 value. A cast locks every skill for 10 seconds.\n\nHome is the night gate: Shop, Skin, Upgrade, the levels, and How to play are there, and the diamond count hangs by the lantern. During a fight, Home at the top returns you there.\n\nThe shop sells one new skin for the hero and one for each soldier. A skin costs 200 diamonds. Buying it does not put it on. Wear it from Skin, and Nothing puts the old clothes back.\n\nOn the website you can keep playing as a guest. That progress stays on the device. Sign in with Google and the levels you have opened, your diamonds, your coins, your ranks, and your skins stay with that account, so a phone, a tablet, and a computer can share them. The first sign-in asks for a name. Ranking lists signed-in players: a higher level cleared ranks above a lower one, and the same level ranks the shorter clear time first. A profile shows that name, the best tag, the hero, and a favourite character.\n\n1 vs 1 is on the home screen. It opens after level 20, and until then the button wears a lock. The first time it opens, a present arrives and a key turns in that lock. It is two clans. Each side chooses 6 of the 11. Both have the same value, the same calls, the same roads, the same wind, and a hero. Before the search, choose Your ranks or Maximum. Your ranks uses the ranks saved on each account. Maximum locks both sides at rank 20. The host's choice is what the match uses, and the other ninja can leave. On this page, press Find opponent. The game looks for one other ninja and connects. The match runs until a gate falls. A 1 vs 1 pays no coins. You do not type an address or a code. On a computer build, Host opens port 3001 and the other ninja joins the address.\n\nEscape or Back returns to the title.": "这是一场侧面的城门战。你的一族城门在左边。咒门在右边。两边都有 2000 血。\n\n战士和英雄都出生在自己城门后面的地面上，所以新的召唤不会站在战斗里。另一边不能走过城门，进入它后面的地面。站在那里的人，当攻击够得到时，仍能打到那座城门前面的战士。原本会打到城门后面某人的一击，改为打在城门上。在自己城堡后面停留 10 秒的战士，会被放到城门前面。\n\n你一开始只有一个召唤，剑忍者。一课结束时，他们的城门破了，九只那种怪物走出来，每条路三个。杀掉全部九只，那个士兵就是你的。在你认识六个之前，带上你有的。之后，选 6 个。价值会自己累积。把手机或 iPad 横过来。按住场地，摇杆出现在那只手下，然后跟着拖曳。召唤按钮沿底部排列，斩击和射击在右下角。\n\n有三条路。士兵只在你召唤他们的那条路上向前走，也只打那条路。狂战士横站在三条路上，一次打中每一条路，每一条路上的敌人都能打到狂战士。刺客闪过其他每一个战士，并跨路去杀弓手、升级术士或治疗术士。她不砍别人。一座房子第一次掉到一半血时，风会帮助那一边：已越过中线的对方战士被吹回中央，并失去他们还有的一半血。你用手下的摇杆，或用 WASD，把英雄移到任何一条路。J 和 K 对应斩击和射击。数字键依序召唤你带来的士兵，召唤到英雄所在的路上。\n\n如果一个奔者溜过队列，要跑回去的人是你。如果你的城门破了，你就输了。在一课里，打破他们的城门还不是结束：九只那种怪物走出来，那九只死了你才赢。在第 40 关，他们的城门倒下之后，一名将军走出来，将军死了你才赢。其他每一关都在他们的城门破掉时结束。\n\n当他们的城门血量掉到四分之一，他们立刻再得到起始的金子。在一半血时，每一关，他们一次得到 100 价值。从第 20 关起，城门还有 70% 血时，他们也得到 100 价值。\n\n对方城门召唤自己的战士。第 1 到 19 关，战斗从行者开始，那一群里的其他怪物在之后的关卡一个一个加入。从第 20 关起，他们是行者、奔者、嚎者、蝮、雷暴、号手、厚壳、掠者，还有鬼。从第 41 关起，那些怪物更快、更难，蛾、老者、饕和巢也加入。嚎者挂在自己城堡后面。只有弓手能在那里打到它。它从城堡后面荡到路上，若有弓手、升级术士或治疗术士活着，就荡到他们身上，然后留在路上。蝮的咬让一名战士停住 2 秒。有一小段时间他们不能移动或攻击，并保持受伤的姿势，直到结束。治疗术士可以解除。如果前面有两名战士，它咬打得较重的那一个，并不困住他们。大多数攻击打不中蝮。雷暴等 4 秒，然后闪电打中前面的战士，再一个一个跳到另外四个身上，每个困住 1 秒。号手每 3 秒召唤两只其他怪物。厚壳很慢，打得很轻，带着很多血。掠者是中等召唤里打得较重的。蛾在一条路上飞。短兵器打不到它，那些战士停在它下面，不过他们仍会打地面上更近的战士。老者出现在路上某处，打最近的人，无论友敌，15 秒后消失。许多攻击打不中老者。饕非常慢。它吃掉前面的战士，狂战士或飞行者除外，然后坐下 5 秒并治疗。巢会咬，死的时候三只快的幼爬出来。在士兵关，他们穿着现代装备，打得比以前更重。短刃对应剑士。火弓血薄、打得重，然后在那个位置留下火 3 秒。扇血薄，几乎不伤人，每 10 秒吹一次自己的路。那阵风只打另一边，把前面的那些战士推回路上的四分之一。狂战士不理那阵风，并掩护他后面的战士。那阵风也会拉长任何火或冰，让它再烧 2 秒。每条路最多两个。大盾带着一面大盾、很多血，伤害是 5。投枪丢出五发长而重的远射，然后近身用短剑打。鼓一次抬起三名盟友，就像升级术士抬起一个。第 21 到 40 关，牛等 4 秒，然后第一下冲锋比之后的攻击更重，它近身打，比骑手更慢、更轻。从第 41 关起，鸦也这样，而且打得更重：它等 3 秒，先重重打第一个敌人，然后像骑手那样打。从第 61 关起，烟、霰、瞄和咏加入。烟不造成伤害，并在走过的地方铺烟。烟雾把那一段藏起 10 秒。霰每秒开一枪，四次，然后装填 2 秒。瞄每 3 秒开一发长而重的枪，血很少。咏唱歌，提升是升级术士的一半，同时作用在每一条路上的每一个盟友。爆者很脆，一击很重，若有狂战士活着就打狂战士。第 40 关的将军是一名军官。\n\n开始列出七十关。第一关是开的。赢了一关就开启下一关。第 1 到 20 关是怪物，每个士兵都在那里学会。第 21 到 40 关是人类士兵。第 41 到 60 关又是怪物，新的怪物从这里开始。第 61 到 70 关交替，先怪物再士兵，从怪物开始。新的士兵在士兵那几关开始。你的钱袋保持不变。他们的随着关卡升高而变重，士兵刚到时会稍轻一点。在你选择带谁之前，这一关会显示另一边，每个战士都有造型和名字。按一个名字，可读血量、伤害、接敌距离、攻击距离、速度，以及特殊技能。\n\n你开启的每一关给 100 颗钻石。过关也给金币。基本额是 200 金币乘上关数。三分钟或更少是双倍，五分钟或更少再加一半，六分钟或更少给基本额，更久的过关给一半。在你还没过的关，战斗还在进行的每一秒，也给那个基本额的 0.25%。那些金币在你的城门倒下时仍留下。已经过的关不给这个。在已过的关，自动结算跳过战斗，并付给你上次过关的金币。你可以领 50 次。缺的时候，每半小时回来 5 次。在记住一次过关之前，赌注是基本额。金币不是钻石。首页有强化。英雄和你学会的每个士兵可以强化 20 次。每一级加上那个角色 5% 的血和伤害。距离、费用和速度不变。强化也可以每次把城堡的血提高 200，并每次把你的价值提高每秒 0.1。二十是最后。每 10 关你选一个技能，技能像战士一样升级，每次使用花 45 价值。一次施放把每个技能锁住 10 秒。\n\n首页是夜里的城门：商店、造型、强化、关卡，以及怎么玩都在那里，钻石的数目挂在灯笼旁。战斗中，上方的首页会把你带回那里。\n\n商店卖英雄的一套新造型，以及每个士兵一套。一套造型要 200 颗钻石。买下并不会穿上。从造型页穿上，原本会把旧衣服换回来。\n\n在网站上你可以继续以访客游玩。那份进度留在这台设备。用 Google 登录后，你开启的关卡、钻石、金币、等级和造型会留在那个账号，所以手机、平板和电脑可以共用。第一次登录会问一个名字。排行列出已登录的玩家：过了较高的关排在前面，同一关则较短的过关时间优先。个人页显示那个名字、最好的标记、英雄，以及一个最爱的角色。\n\n一对一在首页。它在第 20 关之后开启，在那之前按钮带着一把锁。第一次开启时，一份礼物到来，钥匙在锁里转动。这是两个一族。每边选 11 个里的 6 个。两边的价值、召唤、路、风和英雄都一样。搜寻之前，选择你的等级或最高。你的等级用每个账号存下的等级。最高把两边都锁在第 20 级。房主的选择就是这场用的，另一个忍者可以离开。在这一页，按寻找对手。游戏寻找另一个忍者并连上。战斗直到一座城门倒下。一对一不给金币。你不要输入地址或兑换码。在电脑版，开房会打开端口 3001，另一个忍者加入那个地址。\n\nEscape 或返回会回到标题。",
}

static func set_lang(code: String) -> void:
	if code == "zh_cn":
		lang = "zh_cn"
	elif code == "zh":
		lang = "zh"
	else:
		lang = "en"
	_cache.clear()


static func install() -> void:
	if _installed:
		return
	var base: Font = ThemeDB.fallback_font
	if base == null:
		return
	var theme: Theme = ThemeDB.get_default_theme()
	if theme != null:
		_attach(theme.default_font)
		var types: PackedStringArray = theme.get_type_list()
		for type_name in types:
			var items: PackedStringArray = theme.get_font_list(type_name)
			for item_name in items:
				_attach(theme.get_font(item_name, type_name))
	_attach(base)
	_installed = true


static func _attach(face: Font) -> void:
	if face == null or face == CJK_FONT:
		return
	var chain: Array[Font] = []
	var existing: Array = face.fallbacks
	for item in existing:
		var old: Font = item as Font
		if old == null:
			continue
		if old == CJK_FONT:
			return
		chain.append(old)
	chain.append(CJK_FONT)
	face.fallbacks = chain


static func cjk() -> Font:
	install()
	return CJK_FONT


static func font() -> Font:
	install()
	var base: Font = ThemeDB.fallback_font
	if base == null:
		return CJK_FONT
	return base


static func t(source: String) -> String:
	return _t(source, 0)


static func _t(source: String, depth: int) -> String:
	if (lang != "zh" and lang != "zh_cn") or source == "" or depth > 4:
		return source
	if _has_cjk(source):
		return source
	if _cache.has(source):
		return str(_cache[source])
	var out: String = source
	var key := source
	if key.contains("\r"):
		key = key.replace("\r", "")
	var book: Dictionary = MAP
	if lang == "zh_cn":
		book = CN
	if book.has(key) and not _is_template(key):
		out = str(book[key])
	else:
		out = _apply(key, depth)
	_cache[source] = out
	return out


static func _has_cjk(source: String) -> bool:
	var n := source.length()
	for i in n:
		if source.unicode_at(i) >= 0x2E80:
			return true
	return false


static func _is_template(key: String) -> bool:
	return key.contains("%d") or key.contains("%s") or key.contains("%.1f") or key.contains("%02d")


static func _build() -> void:
	if _built:
		return
	_built = true
	var ranked: PackedStringArray = PackedStringArray()
	for key in MAP.keys():
		var k := str(key)
		if not _is_template(k):
			continue
		var placed := false
		var at := 0
		while at < ranked.size():
			if k.length() > ranked[at].length():
				ranked.insert(at, k)
				placed = true
				break
			at += 1
		if not placed:
			ranked.append(k)
	for k in ranked:
		var rx := RegEx.new()
		if rx.compile(_pattern(k)) != OK:
			continue
		_pat_rx.append(rx)
		_pat_zh.append(str(MAP[k]))
		if CN.has(k):
			_pat_cn.append(str(CN[k]))
		else:
			_pat_cn.append(k)


static func _pattern(key: String) -> String:
	var pattern := "^"
	var i := 0
	while i < key.length():
		if key.substr(i, 2) == "%%":
			pattern += "%"
			i += 2
			continue
		if key.substr(i, 4) == "%.1f":
			pattern += "(\\d+\\.\\d)"
			i += 4
			continue
		if key.substr(i, 4) == "%02d":
			pattern += "(\\d+)"
			i += 4
			continue
		if key.substr(i, 2) == "%d":
			pattern += "(\\d+)"
			i += 2
			continue
		if key.substr(i, 2) == "%s":
			if i + 2 < key.length():
				pattern += "(.+?)"
			else:
				pattern += "(.+)"
			i += 2
			continue
		pattern += _esc(key.substr(i, 1))
		i += 1
	pattern += "$"
	return pattern


static func _esc(ch: String) -> String:
	if "\\.+*?^$()[]{}|".contains(ch):
		return "\\" + ch
	return ch


static func _apply(source: String, depth: int) -> String:
	var book: Dictionary = MAP
	if lang == "zh_cn":
		book = CN
	if book.has(source) and not _is_template(source):
		return str(book[source])
	_build()
	var bank: PackedStringArray = _pat_zh
	if lang == "zh_cn":
		bank = _pat_cn
	var n := _pat_rx.size()
	for i in n:
		var rx: RegEx = _pat_rx[i]
		var found: RegExMatch = rx.search(source)
		if found == null:
			continue
		var caps: PackedStringArray = PackedStringArray()
		var count := found.get_group_count()
		for g in range(1, count + 1):
			caps.append(found.get_string(g))
		return _fill(bank[i], caps, depth)
	if book.has(source):
		return str(book[source])
	return source


static func _fill(zh: String, caps: PackedStringArray, depth: int) -> String:
	var out := ""
	var i := 0
	var n := 0
	while i < zh.length():
		if zh.substr(i, 2) == "%%":
			out += "%"
			i += 2
			continue
		var token := ""
		if zh.substr(i, 4) == "%.1f" or zh.substr(i, 4) == "%02d":
			token = zh.substr(i, 4)
			i += 4
		elif zh.substr(i, 2) == "%d" or zh.substr(i, 2) == "%s":
			token = zh.substr(i, 2)
			i += 2
		else:
			out += zh.substr(i, 1)
			i += 1
			continue
		var cap := ""
		if n < caps.size():
			cap = caps[n]
		n += 1
		if token == "%s":
			out += _t(cap, depth + 1)
		else:
			out += cap
	return out

